Subject: [PATCH 16/59] misc/esp32-ipc: introduce generic IPC for ESP32

Signed-off-by: Max Filippov <jcmvbkbc@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 033f057b3641228e9b342e736d4d9c99b36313fa)
---
 drivers/misc/Kconfig          |   6 +
 drivers/misc/Makefile         |   1 +
 drivers/misc/esp32-ipc.c      | 244 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/misc/esp32-ipc.h      |  18 +++
 include/linux/esp32-ipc-api.h |  13 ++
 5 files changed, 282 insertions(+)
